egarded as a privilege, and the subsequent execution of the research project by a PhD candidate is a major undertaking. It requires the application of considerable depth and breadth of scholarship, and there must be substantial discovery of new science. The final PhD thesis must reflect clearly and completely the fulfillment of these criteria.\nIn fulfilling the degree requirements, the candidate is expected to conduct the thesis research under the supervision of a designated supervisor. In addition, the candidate must attend and present seminars, and undertake course work.\nPrivacySitemap\nCopyright \u00a9 The Hong Kong University of Science and Technology. All rights reserved.\nFollow HKUST on\nFacebook\nLinkedIn\nInstagram\nYoutube\nCopyright \u00a9 The Hong Kong University of Science and Technology. All rights reserved.", "links": [["Skip to main content", "https://chem.hkust.edu.hk/pg/PhD-Chem#main-content"], ["University News", "https://www.ust.hk/news"], ["Academic Departments A-Z", "https://www.ust.hk/academics/list"], ["Life@HKUST", "https://www.ust.hk/lifehkust"], ["Library", "http://library.ust.hk/"], ["Map & Directions", "https://www.ust.hk/map-directions"], ["Careers at HKUST", "https://hkustcareers.ust.hk"], ["Faculty Profiles", "https://facultyprofiles.ust.hk/"], ["About HKUST", "https://www.ust.hk/about"], ["School of Science", "https://science.ust.hk/"], ["", "https://chem.hkust.edu.hk/pg/PhD-Chem"], ["A", "https://chem.hkust.edu.hk/pg/PhD-Chem"], ["A", "https://chem.hkust.edu.hk/pg/PhD-Chem"], ["A", "https://chem.hkust.edu.hk/pg/PhD-Chem"], ["Search", "https://chem.hkust.edu.hk/pg/PhD-Chem"], ["HKUST HKUST HKUST", "https://www.ust.hk"], ["DEPARTMENT OF CHEMISTRY", "https://chem.hkust.edu.hk/"], ["About", "https://chem.hkust.edu.hk/the-department/introduction"], ["UG Programs", "https://chem.hkust.edu.hk/programs/UG-overview"], ["Admission", "https://chem.hkust.edu.hk/programs/Undergraduate-Admission"], ["Programs & Courses", "https://chem.hkust.edu